title: Day8_Hephaestus_Intro
tags:
---
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" "right" "bottom" #e06666>>
Aphrodite: Aelius, it is good to see you again.
Aelius: Hello, Aphrodite! What brings you here today?
Aphrodite: Practical as always my dear – Hephaestus and I have agreed to talk over lunch. I see I am early.
Aelius: Yeah, I haven't seen him today.
Aphrodite: I am not worried, Hephaestus never misses an appointment – even if he is not always punctual.
Aelius: Sounds like him.
Aphrodite: So what do you think of him? You know him as he is now better than me.

-> He's come a long way.
    <<AddHephaestusAffinity 2>>
    Aphrodite: I hope so. It's been so long since I've spoken to him.
    Aphrodite: Thank you, that's calmed my nerves.
-> I think he still has things to work on.
    <<AddHephaestusAffinity 1>>
    Aphrodite: I suppose I should expect so.
    Aphrodite: Still, thank you - that's calmed my nerves.
-> I'm not sure.
    Aphrodite: He can be hard to read, I understand.

Aelius: So... do you want anything to eat?
Aphrodite: No thank you, dear. That said, why don't you make something for Hephaestus? He still likes <b>Helios Steak,</b> correct?
Aelius: Yeah, I'll get on it.

// HELIOS STEAK
<<AddHephaestusAffinity 2>>
<<StartCooking "HeliosSteak4">>

<<HideAll>>
===
title: Day8_Hephaestus_ReturnFancy
tags:
---
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" "left" "bottom" #e06666>>
Hephaestus: Oh, Aelius, there you are.
Aphrodite: Welcome back, dear. That looks wonderful.
<<Hide Aphrodite>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
Aelius: Uh- everything going okay out here?
Hephaestus: Don’t worry about me. Let's see what you’ve cooked up.

Hephaestus: Oh… I remember having one of these when we first met – of course it wasn't this fancy at the time.

Hephaestus: Thank you, Aphrodite.
<<Hide Aelius>>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" "left" "bottom" #e06666>>
Aphrodite: Of course.
Hephaestus: And I'm sorry it took so long to talk to you again.
Aphrodite: Thank you. I should have made an effort myself, instead of running away.
Hephaestus: I knew you had been unhappy for a while before it happened; I just couldn’t keep up with you all the time.
Aphrodite: It’s alright. I've gotten older since then, I've learned contentment, more than just passion.
Aphrodite: I’ve learned from the mortals – they don’t have eternity to make up for their mistakes.
Hephaestus: I’m glad I have eternity, personally.
Hephaestus: But I understand. I think I need to allow myself to feel more passion.
Aphrodite: You have fear, which makes it more difficult – an uncommon emotion on Olympus.
Aphrodite: Omnipresent among the mortals however, I have seen how they navigate it. How they fail to escape it.
Aphrodite: I want to help you.
Hephaestus: I've missed you.
Aphrodite: And I, you.
Aphrodite: Do you still make those roses from the bronze?
Hephaestus: I haven't forgotten how.
<<Hide Aphrodite>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
Aelius: Ahem...
Hephaestus: Oh- yes. Sorry, Aelius.
Aelius: So… did you find out anything about, like, you being my dad, maybe?
Hephaestus: I’m sorry, I have no idea. There were, um, a few times it could have been, but it was a difficult period for me and my recollection is imperfect.

-> That's alright, thank you all the same.
    <<AddHephaestusAffinity 2>>
    Hephaestus: Thank you, Aelius, you have helped me a great deal. Let me know if you need anything in the future.
-> Let me know if you remember anything later.
    <<AddHephaestusAffinity 1>>
    Hephaestus: Of course, Aelius, you have helped me a great deal. Let me know if you need anything in the future.
-> I still don’t get why Aphrodite can’t just tell me.
    Hephaestus: Love – she works in mysterious ways, as they say.
    Hephaestus: You have helped me a great deal, just let me know if you need anything in the future.

Aelius: Feel free to come by the diner any time.
<<Hide Hephaestus>>
<<Act "Aphrodite" "Aphrodite" "right" "bottom" #e06666>>
Aphrodite: Goodbye, Aelius.
<<Hide Aphrodite>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
Hephaestus: Farewell, Aelius.
<<HideAll>>
<<jump Day8_Hermes_Intro>>
===
